## General Comment Rules
- Prefer self-documenting variable and function names
- Comments are most useful to explain "why" not the "how" that are not self-evident from the code
- If a comment is needed, add a concise comment
- Follow examples of comments from the code base on striking the right balance

## Comments Updates
- Do not delete existing comments
- If the code the comment exists for changes, update the comment in that style
